---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Destinations" description="Where we work in Malaysia: Kuala Lumpur, Penang, Melaka, and Borneo. Every state has its own palate, its own hawkers, its own arguments about the correct version of a dish.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-brand-800 text-white py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-white max-w-2xl">Where we work.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/85 max-w-3xl">Every state in Malaysia has its own palate, its own hawkers, its own argument about whose version of a dish is correct. These are the places we know best and bring groups to most often.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Destinations Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <a href="/destinations/kuala-lumpur.html" class="block bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow overflow-hidden">
          <div class="h-48 bg-brand-200" style="background-image: url(https://cdn.simplyenak.com/payload-media/kl-street-food-tour-chinatown-char-siu-bao-hidden-vendor-steamer.jpg); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Kuala Lumpur</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Malay, Chinese, Indian, and Mamak food cultures on the same street, sometimes in the same meal. KL is where the whole country's eating converges.</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Explore KL &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/destinations/penang.html" class="block bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow overflow-hidden">
          <div class="h-48 bg-brand-200" style="background-image: url(https://cdn.simplyenak.com/payload-media/Penang008.jpg); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"></div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Penang</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Hokkien mee, char kway teow, assam laksa. The same families at the same stalls for four generations. Hawker centres open before dawn, close when the food runs out.</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Explore Penang &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/destinations/melaka.html" class="block bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow overflow-hidden">
          <div class="h-48 bg-brand-300 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-white font-serif text-lg font-semibold">Melaka</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Melaka</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Chicken rice balls, devil curry, Nyonya laksa. A Portuguese-Dutch-Chinese-Malay kitchen collision. Compact enough to eat through in a weekend.</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Explore Melaka &rarr;</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <div class="block bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm overflow-hidden opacity-75">
          <div class="h-48 bg-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-white font-serif text-lg font-semibold">Borneo</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Borneo</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Sabah and Sarawak eat differently from the peninsula. Hinava with bambangan, wild fern stir-fries, bamboo chicken over open flame.</p>
            <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-brand-500 font-medium">Coming soon</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Multi-city -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">Multi-city routes.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-brand-700 max-w-3xl">Most of our trips combine two or more places. Penang and Melaka share a coastline but eat nothing alike. KL connects to everything by road, rail, or short flight. Borneo is a separate chapter entirely.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-brand-700 max-w-3xl">We design routes around eating. Which markets hit on which days. Where to stop between cities. How to structure a trip so your group isn't eating the same style of food two meals in a row.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-800 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold">Ready to plan a trip?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Tell us what you are looking for. Destination, group size, pace, dietary needs. We will build something around the food.</p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="/contact.html" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
